\small
\setlength{\tabcolsep}{4pt}
\caption{Stage-by-stage correspondence between classical phase correlation and the proposed architecture.}
\label{tab:pc_correspondence}
\begin{tabular}{lll}
\toprule
Stage & Classical phase correlation & This architecture 
\midrule
